# Files excluded from the published package archive.
#
# NOTE: .pubignore REPLACES .gitignore for pub — it does not extend it. Every
# rule that matters for the archive has to be repeated here, otherwise local
# artifacts would be published straight from a working copy.

# docs.page sources. The service reads them from the Git repository, not from
# the pub archive, and pub's layout convention reserves the singular "doc/" for
# a top-level documentation directory — a plural "docs/" in the archive makes
# `dart pub publish --dry-run` emit a warning. Keeping them out of the archive
# satisfies both, and pub.dev does not render .mdx anyway.
docs/
docs.json

# CI and toolchain pinning: only meaningful inside the Git repository.
.github/
.fvm/
.fvmrc

# example/ is intentionally NOT ignored: pub.dev renders it on the package page.

# Mirrors .gitignore
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
pubspec.lock
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.planning/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
